This runtime is part of Project Namirha.
Sovereign author: Schnee Bashtabanic.

The arithmetic / echo / quantities / scan checks were first written in the
plain-witness / clause-runtime trees (2026-08-14). They sit in checks/ and
are not called. The sovereign aborted that environment before evaluating
it. They are not the parent of this runtime. Wiring them is a gate.

